{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8613-1",
  "summary": "FreeIPMI vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Zhihan Zheng discovered that FreeIPMI had several buffer overflow\nvulnerabilities in ipmi-oem response message handling. A local attacker\nwith control a malicious IPMI device or simulator could possibly cause\nFreeIPMI to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-33554,\nCVE-2026-50031)",
